# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Supabase Edge Function secrets (SERVER-SIDE ONLY).
# These are NOT shipped in the app. Set them in your Supabase project with:
#   supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-... --env-file supabase/.env
# For local `supabase functions serve`, copy this to `supabase/.env`.
#
# NEVER commit the real values. `supabase/.env` is git-ignored.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Claude API key used by the extract-receipt function for vision extraction.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key

# Optional. Model used by extract-receipt; defaults to the value in
# functions/extract-receipt/index.ts. Set a cheaper model if cost per receipt
# matters more than accuracy.
# CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5

# Injected automatically by Supabase at runtime (do not set in production),
# but needed for local `functions serve`:
# SUPABASE_URL=http://localhost:54321
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-local-service-role-key
